      "quote": "With regards to conflicts of interest, employee(s) who does not actively report or avoid such conflicts of interest, disciplinary actions will be taken up to including retain post on probation or above depending on the severity of the violation upon discovery; if the violation is serious and has caused losses, the disciplinary action will be taken up to terminate the employment contract(s) with such employee(s);",
